1
00:00:03,510 --> 00:00:09,620
Southern Sunshine

2
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:16,940
Today is the twenty-eighth Tet.

3
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:24,310
Flower market on Nguyen Hue street is crowded.

4
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:35,740
Uyen and friends walk among flower garden.

5
00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:51,280
Whole group suddenly thinks of Van - friend from summer camp at Nha Trang.

6
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:58,050
Hue says:

7
00:00:59,250 --> 00:01:09,080
Van wrote letter saying Hanoi is very cold.

8
00:01:11,080 --> 00:01:19,600
Wish we could send Van some Southern sunshine!

9
00:01:21,020 --> 00:01:28,050
After thinking a moment, Phong exclaims:

10
00:01:29,740 --> 00:01:42,680
We will give little Van something North doesn't have, that is ... a peach branch!

11
00:01:44,820 --> 00:01:53,080
A peach branch? All stunned, then shout together. Right!

12
00:01:53,880 --> 00:02:01,850
A peach branch carries Southern sunshine.

13
00:02:03,420 --> 00:02:19,080
Whole group happily returns to start of Nguyen Hue street, where a forest of yellow peach branches sways in sunshine.

